BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 575.56 Tm (model, group detections into hotspots, verify them with Clay, and finally) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 559.94 Tm (forecast drift.") Tj ET
